abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of a twelve-stage operational redshift handoff for a
  declared complex-Psi/complex-chi C19 lattice action. The artifact proves C19
  geometry and clock algebra, a scoped uniform-branch obstruction, positivity
  of a coupled phase branch, and exact endpoint readout identities. It does not
  prove dynamical source formation, an absolute SI scale, the Einstein field
  equations, or a unique physical light sector.
